{
  "Numbers.11.20.19-t.html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/strict.dtd\"><HTML>\n<!-- \n     Computer generated from NoteMaker[20 Jan 2026]: \n     Changes file: 2022.10.19 - Changes.xml, date: 2022.07.02, number: 20 .\n     Remove this token \"****COMPUTER-GENERATED****\" if you edit this file manually.\n-->\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/>\n  <title>Numbers 11:20.19</title>\n</head>\n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n  <h1>Numbers 11:20.19</h1>\n  <h2>Add note 't' as text is damaged.</h2>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"5pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>\n          <img src=\"../../Changes/2022.10.19 - Changes/images/2022.07.02/20-Detail.jpg\"  border=\"4pt\">\n          </img>\n        </center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>Credit: Sefaria.org.</center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>\n                    The lower half of the word is damaged.\n               </p>\n  <p>\n                    The current text agrees with that of the Miqra According to the Masorah (MAM).\n               </p>\n  <p>\n    <b>\n      <i>Daniel Holman</i>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"right\">\n    <b><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Changes/2022.10.19 - Changes/2022.10.19 - Changes.xml?2022.07.02-20\">2022.10.19 - Changes.xml : 2022.07.02-20</a>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"20pt\"  border=\"1pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?t\">All \"Transcription uncertain\" ('t') notes</a></center>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body></HTML>",
  "Numbers.15.38.14-m.html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/strict.dtd\"><HTML>\n<!-- \n     Computer generated from NoteMaker[20 Jan 2026]: \n     Changes file: 2022.10.19 - Changes.xml, date: 2022.07.02, number: 22 .\n     Remove this token \"****COMPUTER-GENERATED****\" if you edit this file manually.\n-->\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/>\n  <title>Numbers 15:38.14</title>\n</head>\n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n  <h1>Numbers 15:38.14</h1>\n  <h2>Add note 'm' for possible merkha rather than meteg under first nun.</h2>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"5pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>\n          <img src=\"../../Changes/2022.10.19 - Changes/images/2022.07.02/22-Detail.jpg\"  border=\"4pt\">\n          </img>\n        </center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>Credit: Sefaria.org.</center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>\n                    The near-vertical line under the nun lacks a northeast-southwest inclination.\n               </p>\n  <p>\n                    The Miqra According to the Masorah (MAM) has a merkha rather than a meteg under the nun.\n               </p>\n  <p>\n    <b>\n      <i>Daniel Holman</i>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"right\">\n    <b><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Changes/2022.10.19 - Changes/2022.10.19 - Changes.xml?2022.07.02-22\">2022.10.19 - Changes.xml : 2022.07.02-22</a>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"20pt\"  border=\"1pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?m\">All \"This meteg is a merkha in other texts.\" ('m') notes</a></center>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body></HTML>",
  "Numbers.17.27.11-t.html": "<HTML>\n<!-- \n     Computer generated from NoteMaker[26 Jul 2022]: \n     Changes file: 2022.07.04 - Changes.xml, date: 2022.04.04, number: 8 .\n     Remove this token \"****COMPUTER-GENERATED****\" if you edit this file manually.\n-->\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/>\n  <title>Numbers 17:27.11</title>\n</head>\n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n  <h1>Numbers 17:27.11</h1>\n  <h2>Possible dagesh in nun, add note 't'.</h2>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"5pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>\n          <img src=\"../../Changes/2022.07.04 - Changes/images/2022.04.04/8-Detail.jpg\"  border=\"4pt\">\n          </img>\n        </center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>Credit: Sefaria.org.</center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>The dagesh is smaller than expected and slightly too high. Not expected grammatically.</p>\n  <p>\n    <b>\n      <i>Daniel Holman</i>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"right\">\n    <b>2022.07.04 - Changes.xml : 2022.04.04-8\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"20pt\"  border=\"1pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?t\">All \"Transcription uncertain\" ('t') notes</a></center>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body></HTML>",
  "Numbers.22.23.14-t.html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/strict.dtd\"><HTML>\n<!-- \n     Computer generated from NoteMaker[20 Jan 2026]: \n     Changes file: 2022.10.19 - Changes.xml, date: 2022.07.02, number: 24 .\n     Remove this token \"****COMPUTER-GENERATED****\" if you edit this file manually.\n-->\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/>\n  <title>Numbers 22:23.14</title>\n</head>\n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n  <h1>Numbers 22:23.14</h1>\n  <h2>Dagesh on dalet is light. Add 't' note.</h2>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"5pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>\n          <img src=\"../../Changes/2022.10.19 - Changes/images/2022.07.02/24-Detail.jpg\"  border=\"4pt\">\n          </img>\n        </center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>Credit: Sefaria.org.</center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>\n                    The dagesh on the dalet is light, but well positioned.\n               </p>\n  <p>\n    <b>\n      <i>Daniel Holman</i>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"right\">\n    <b><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Changes/2022.10.19 - Changes/2022.10.19 - Changes.xml?2022.07.02-24\">2022.10.19 - Changes.xml : 2022.07.02-24</a>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"20pt\"  border=\"1pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?t\">All \"Transcription uncertain\" ('t') notes</a></center>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body></HTML>",
  "Numbers.22.9.8-t.html": "<HTML>\n<!-- \n     Computer generated from NoteMaker[26 Jul 2022]: \n     Changes file: 2022.07.04 - Changes.xml, date: 2022.04.04, number: 9 .\n     Remove this token \"****COMPUTER-GENERATED****\" if you edit this file manually.\n-->\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/>\n  <title>Numbers 22:9.8</title>\n</head>\n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n  <h1>Numbers 22:9.8</h1>\n  <h2>Possible segol on aleph, no text change, add note 't'.</h2>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"5pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>\n          <img src=\"../../Changes/2022.07.04 - Changes/images/2022.04.04/9-Detail.jpg\"  border=\"4pt\">\n          </img>\n        </center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>Credit: Sefaria.org.</center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>The lowest dot of the segol is reddish, but has good size and position. \n                  A segol is unexpected here, however.</p>\n  <p>\n    <b>\n      <i>Daniel Holman</i>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"right\">\n    <b>2022.07.04 - Changes.xml : 2022.04.04-9\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"20pt\"  border=\"1pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?t\">All \"Transcription uncertain\" ('t') notes</a></center>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body></HTML>",
  "Numbers.25.12.8-c.html": "<html>\n<header profile=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/11/profile\" > \n        <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/> \n        <title>Numbers 25:12.8</title>\n</header>\n    \n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n        <h1>Numbers 25:12.8</h1>\n        <h4>The vav is unbroken.</h4>\n        \n        <table align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"5pt\"><tr><td>\n            <center>\n                <img src=\"../../Changes/2021.10.19 - Changes/images/2021.03.17/3-Detail.jpg\" border=\"4pt\"/>\n            </center>\n        </td></tr>\n        <p/>\n        <tr><td>\n            <center><i>Credit: Sefaria.org.\n            </i></center>\n        </td></tr>\n        </table>\n        <p/>\n            Later Ashkenazi texts have a broken vav; the earlier LC and MAM texts do not.\n        <p/> \n        <b><i>CVK</i></b>\n        <p/>\n        <p align=\"right\"><b>2021.10.19 - Changes.xml : 2021.03.17-3</b></p>\n        <p/>\n        <table border=\"1pt\" align=\"center\" cellpadding=\"16pt\">\n            <tr><td>\n              <span style=\"color:blue;font-size:14pt\">\n                  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?c\">All \"Text is correct\" ('c') notes</a>\n              </span>\n              <p/>\n              <span style=\"color:blue;font-size:14pt\">\n                  <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n              </span>\n            </td?</tr>\n        </table>\n        <p/>\n        </body>\n</html>\n",
  "Numbers.32.20.10-m.html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/strict.dtd\"><HTML>\n<!-- \n     Computer generated from NoteMaker[20 Jan 2026]: \n     Changes file: 2022.10.19 - Changes.xml, date: 2022.07.02, number: 25 .\n     Remove this token \"****COMPUTER-GENERATED****\" if you edit this file manually.\n-->\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/>\n  <title>Numbers 32:20.10</title>\n</head>\n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n  <h1>Numbers 32:20.10</h1>\n  <h2>Add note 'm' for possible merkha rather than meteg under het.</h2>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"5pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>\n          <img src=\"../../Changes/2022.10.19 - Changes/images/2022.07.02/25-Detail.jpg\"  border=\"4pt\">\n          </img>\n        </center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>Credit: Sefaria.org.</center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>\n                    The near-vertical line under the gimel lacks a northeast-southwest inclination.\n               </p>\n  <p>\n                    The Miqra According to the Masorah (MAM) has a merkha rather than a meteg under the het.\n               </p>\n  <p>\n    <b>\n      <i>Daniel Holman</i>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"right\">\n    <b><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Changes/2022.10.19 - Changes/2022.10.19 - Changes.xml?2022.07.02-25\">2022.10.19 - Changes.xml : 2022.07.02-25</a>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"20pt\"  border=\"1pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?m\">All \"This meteg is a merkha in other texts.\" ('m') notes</a></center>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body></HTML>",
  "Numbers.33.14.3-t.html": "<HTML>\n<!-- \n     Computer generated from NoteMaker[26 Jul 2022]: \n     Changes file: 2022.07.04 - Changes.xml, date: 2022.04.04, number: 13 .\n     Remove this token \"****COMPUTER-GENERATED****\" if you edit this file manually.\n-->\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/>\n  <title>Numbers 33:14.3</title>\n</head>\n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n  <h1>Numbers 33:14.3</h1>\n  <h2>Remove dagesh from yod, add note 't'.</h2>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"5pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>\n          <img src=\"../../Changes/2022.07.04 - Changes/images/2022.04.04/13-Detail.jpg\"  border=\"4pt\">\n          </img>\n        </center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>Credit: Sefaria.org.</center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>The yod appears on top of a splotch in the paper. \n                    A slight darkening in that splotch might be a yod.\n                    A dagesh on the yod is expected, however.</p>\n  <p>\n    <b>\n      <i>Daniel Holman</i>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"right\">\n    <b>2022.07.04 - Changes.xml : 2022.04.04-13\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"20pt\"  border=\"1pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?t\">All \"Transcription uncertain\" ('t') notes</a></center>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body></HTML>",
  "Numbers.34.28.5-t.html": "<HTML>\n<!-- \n     Computer generated from NoteMaker[26 Jul 2022]: \n     Changes file: 2022.07.04 - Changes.xml, date: 2022.04.04, number: 14 .\n     Remove this token \"****COMPUTER-GENERATED****\" if you edit this file manually.\n-->\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/>\n  <title>Numbers 34:28.5</title>\n</head>\n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n  <h1>Numbers 34:28.5</h1>\n  <h2>Possible dagesh in he, add note 't'.</h2>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"5pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>\n          <img src=\"../../Changes/2022.07.04 - Changes/images/2022.04.04/14-Detail.jpg\"  border=\"4pt\">\n          </img>\n        </center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>Credit: Sefaria.org.</center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>A possible dagesh appears in the he. \n               It is well-positioned, but light, with a darker portion to the northeast.\n               A dagesh in the he (mapiq) is unlikely here.</p>\n  <p>\n    <b>\n      <i>Daniel Holman</i>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"right\">\n    <b>2022.07.04 - Changes.xml : 2022.04.04-14\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"20pt\"  border=\"1pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?t\">All \"Transcription uncertain\" ('t') notes</a></center>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body></HTML>",
  "Numbers.36.1.1-t.html": "<HTML>\n<!-- \n     Computer generated from NoteMaker[26 Jul 2022]: \n     Changes file: 2022.07.04 - Changes.xml, date: 2022.04.04, number: 15 .\n     Remove this token \"****COMPUTER-GENERATED****\" if you edit this file manually.\n-->\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/>\n  <title>Numbers 36:1.1</title>\n</head>\n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n  <h1>Numbers 36:1.1</h1>\n  <h2>Remove dagesh from yod; add 't' note.</h2>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"5pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>\n          <img src=\"../../Changes/2022.07.04 - Changes/images/2022.04.04/15-Detail.jpg\"  border=\"4pt\">\n          </img>\n        </center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>Credit: Sefaria.org.</center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>No dagesh apparent although one is expected grammatically.</p>\n  <p>\n    <b>\n      <i>Daniel Holman</i>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"right\">\n    <b>2022.07.04 - Changes.xml : 2022.04.04-15\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"20pt\"  border=\"1pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?t\">All \"Transcription uncertain\" ('t') notes</a></center>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body></HTML>",
  "Numbers.7.59.17-c.html": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01//EN\" \"http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/strict.dtd\"><HTML>\n<!-- \n     Computer generated from NoteMaker[20 Jan 2026]: \n     Changes file: 2021.10.19 - Changes.xml, date: 2021.08.07, number: 16 .\n     Remove this token \"****COMPUTER-GENERATED****\" if you edit this file manually.\n-->\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/>\n  <title>Numbers 7:59.17</title>\n</head>\n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n  <h1>Numbers 7:59.17</h1>\n  <h2>Word lacks accent, add note 'c'; MAM combines this word with the following word without a Maqaf or space.</h2>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"5pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>\n          <img src=\"../../Changes/2021.10.19 - Changes/images/2021.08.07/16-Detail.jpg\"  border=\"4pt\">\n          </img>\n        </center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>Credit: Sefaria.org.</center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>In the LC the space following this word is clear.</p>\n  <p>\n    <b>\n      <i>Ben Denckla</i>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"right\">\n    <b><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Changes/2021.10.19 - Changes/2021.10.19 - Changes.xml?2021.08.07-16\">2021.10.19 - Changes.xml : 2021.08.07-16</a>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"20pt\"  border=\"1pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?c\">All \"Text is correct relative to LC. Usually this marks a peculiarity of the LC relative to the other Masoretic texts.\" ('c') notes</a></center>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body></HTML>",
  "Numbers.7.72.9-c.html": "<HTML>\n<!-- \n     Computer generated from NoteMaker[26 Jul 2022]: \n     Changes file: 2022.07.04 - Changes.xml, date: 2022.04.04, number: 5 .\n     Remove this token \"****COMPUTER-GENERATED****\" if you edit this file manually.\n-->\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/>\n  <title>Numbers 7:72.9</title>\n</head>\n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n  <h1>Numbers 7:72.9</h1>\n  <h2>Replace segol under bet with qamats; add note 'c'.</h2>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"5pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>\n          <img src=\"../../Changes/2022.07.04 - Changes/images/2022.04.04/5-Detail.jpg\"  border=\"4pt\">\n          </img>\n        </center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>Credit: Sefaria.org.</center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>A qamats is unexpected here.</p>\n  <p>\n    <b>\n      <i>Daniel Holman</i>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"right\">\n    <b>2022.07.04 - Changes.xml : 2022.04.04-5\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"20pt\"  border=\"1pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?c\">All \"Text is correct relative to LC. Usually this marks a peculiarity of the LC relative to the other Masoretic texts.\" ('c') notes</a></center>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body></HTML>",
  "Numbers.9.17.6-t.html": "<HTML>\n<!-- \n     Computer generated from NoteMaker[26 Jul 2022]: \n     Changes file: 2022.07.04 - Changes.xml, date: 2022.04.04, number: 6 .\n     Remove this token \"****COMPUTER-GENERATED****\" if you edit this file manually.\n-->\n<head><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\"/>\n  <title>Numbers 9:17.6</title>\n</head>\n<body background=\"../../Images/Background\">\n  <h1>Numbers 9:17.6</h1>\n  <h2>Remove maqaf on yod; add 't' note.</h2>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"5pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>\n          <img src=\"../../Changes/2022.07.04 - Changes/images/2022.04.04/6-Detail.jpg\"  border=\"4pt\">\n          </img>\n        </center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <center>Credit: Sefaria.org.</center>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n  <p>Very, very slight evidence of a maqef between the yod and the bet.</p>\n  <p>\n    <b>\n      <i>Daniel Holman</i>\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <p align=\"right\">\n    <b>2022.07.04 - Changes.xml : 2022.04.04-6\n    </b>\n  </p>\n  <table align=\"center\"  cellpadding=\"20pt\"  border=\"1pt\">\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml?t\">All \"Transcription uncertain\" ('t') notes</a></center>\n        </p>\n        <p>\n          <center><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"../../Supplements/Notes.xml\">Note index</a></center>\n        </p>\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n</body></HTML>"
}
